{"version":"1.6.0-alpha.5","notes":"## 1.6.0-alpha.5 - 2026-11-01\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Keep the selected item and scrollbar position stable while browsing long clipboard histories (#2159)\n- Prevent the app from getting stuck connecting during startup or a background service restart (#2162)\n- Show sending and receiving progress for file transfers even before their history items appear (#2161)\n- Keep the tray icon visible against KDE panel colors and update it when the theme changes (#2158)\n- Correct the size of macOS menu bar icons, including the cat icon (#2157)\n- Remove remaining interface shadows when reduced visual effects are enabled (#2151)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.6.0-alpha.5 - 2026-11-01\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复浏览大量剪贴板历史时选中条目意外切换、滚动条位置跳动的问题 (#2159)\n- 修复应用启动或后台服务重启时可能一直停留在连接中的问题 (#2162)\n- 修复文件发送和接收进度未显示的问题，历史条目出现前也能查看进度 (#2161)\n- 修复 KDE 面板上的托盘图标不清晰的问题，并在主题变化时及时更新图标颜色 (#2158)\n- 修正 macOS 菜单栏图标的大小，包括猫咪图标 (#2157)\n- 修复启用减少视觉效果后界面仍有阴影的问题 (#2151)","confirmation_required":false,"confirmation_description":null,"pub_date":"2026-11-01T08:34:34Z","platforms":{"linux-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.5/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.5_aarch64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"linux-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.5/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.5_amd64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"windows-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.5/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.5_arm64-setup.exe"},"windows-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.5/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.5_x64-setup.exe"},"darwin-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.5/UniClipboard_aarch64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"},"darwin-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.5/UniClipboard_x86_64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"}}}